ONEDRAFT
CAD-AI — Aria Powered
Executable Application Stack & Implementation Architecture
Version 1.0
Status: Implementation Specification
Predecessor: OneDraft Database Schema & OpenAPI Contract v0.1
Database: PostgreSQL
API: REST / JSON
API Version: /api/v1
Identifiers: UUID
Primary Model: Versioned OneDraft Project Model
AI Layer: Aria Powered
