14. UNIT OF WORK
Every command that modifies the project model shall execute through a transaction boundary.
Conceptually:
with unit_of_work() as uow:

    project = uow.projects.get(project_id)

    command = validate_command(...)

    result = project_model.execute(command)

    uow.commit()
If execution fails:
ROLLBACK
No partial state is permitted.

