22. COMMAND PRECONDITIONS
Commands must verify:
project exists
user authorized
revision is current
target objects exist
target objects are compatible
constraints permit operation
command parameters are valid
The system must reject stale mutations.

23. OPTIMISTIC CONCURRENCY
Commands that mutate a project must include an expected revision.
Example:
expected_revision = 14
If the current project revision is:
15
the command fails with:
STALE_REVISION
The client must retrieve the current state before retrying.

