bounding volumes
geometry validation
geometry versioning
The geometry engine is independent of the web UI.

32. GEOMETRY REPRESENTATION
The architecture shall distinguish:
semantic element
from:
computed geometry
For example:
Wall
is the semantic object.
Its generated geometry may include:
centerline
profile
solid
