      ↓
GEOMETRY SOLVER
      ↓
TOPOLOGY
      ↓
GEOMETRY VALIDATION
      ↓
GEOMETRY VERSION
      ↓
OBJECT STORAGE / GEOMETRY STORE

34. GEOMETRY HASHING
Every computed geometry payload receives a deterministic hash.
Conceptually:
geometry_hash =
HASH(
    model_version_id
    +
    element_id
    +
    geometry_parameters
)
This permits:
deduplication
cache validation
reproducibility
stale-output detection

35. GEOMETRY CACHE
Repeated geometry calculations should be cacheable.
The cache key shall incorporate:
element_id
model_version_id
geometry_version
parameter_hash
The cache must never override authoritative model state.

36. SPATIAL INDEX
The geometry subsystem should maintain a spatial acceleration structure for:
